# Copy to .env (gitignored). Secrets only: providers, chains, uses, mode and every other tunable are settings
# (WebUI → Sistema → Voce, stored by Themis).
#
# Provider keys: one line per named provider that needs one, ECHO_KEY_<NAME> (name upper-case, "-" → "_").
# A provider without its key is skipped by every chain. Local engines (whisper-locale, kokoro, piper) need none;
# self-hosted OpenAI-compatible servers (Speaches, LocalAI) need none either.
# ECHO_KEY_GROQ=
# ECHO_KEY_OPENAI=
# ECHO_KEY_GOOGLE=
# ECHO_KEY_ELEVENLABS=
